# WHITE PAPER: THE 80/20 DECENTRALIZED CLIPPING & AUDIENCE-OWNED MEDIA NETWORK
**Edition:** Grand Theft Auto VI Global Launch  
**Model Type:** Decentralized Creator Distribution & Venture Incubation  

---

## EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

With *Grand Theft Auto VI* launching globally on November 19, 2026, gaming and streaming culture is entering the largest single-title attention surge in entertainment history. Historically, top creators capture 100% of platform ad revenue while unpaid fans or low-wage editors generate viral short-form distribution across TikTok, YouTube Shorts, Instagram Reels, and X.

This white paper outlines an institutional-grade **80/20 Audience-Owned Media Model**:

1. **The Creator/Streamer** broadcasts raw gameplay, roleplay, and community events, relinquishing **80% of all streaming and social media ad revenue** into a shared pool for their clipping community.
2. **The Creator retains 20% off the top** of all ad/stream revenue, plus **100% of direct-to-consumer (DTC) commerce, merchandise, digital products, sponsorships, and core brand equity**.
3. **The Audience/Clippers** compete for performance-weighted payouts from the 80% pool, save their capital, and graduate from taking variable pool cuts to **incorporating their own independent media company**—paying themselves lucrative W-2 executive salaries and building a multi-creator media empire.

