## 1. THE THESIS: ATTENTION ARBITRAGE AT LAUNCH SCALE

At the launch of *GTA VI*, millions of viewers will flood Twitch, Kick, and YouTube simultaneously. Individual creators cannot out-edit or out-post a coordinated swarm of hyper-engaged fans.

* **The Traditional Creator Bottleneck:** A streamer hires 1–2 editors at a flat rate, captures 100% of platform payouts, and leaves 90% of viral moments unclipped and unseen.
* **The 80/20 Swarm Advantage:** By turning the audience into a decentralized distribution army with a **4-to-1 financial upside** in their favor, the streamer achieves total algorithmic saturation across every major social feed without spending a dollar on paid user acquisition.

